cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this guide, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Průvodce FAIR daty / FAIR data guide (EOSC CZ)"
abstract: >-
  An interactive Czech and English guide that leads researchers, data stewards, repository administrators
  and research communities along the path to FAIR data. It builds on the FAIR analysis for the National
  Repository Platform and the National Data Infrastructure (NRP/NDI, version 1.2) and reflects the current
  state of national services. Its content is published as an RO-Crate knowledge base with paradata.
